        "created_at": "2013-10-13T08:09:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>VICTORY! :D&nbsp;</strong>Another?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Also, you guys often seem to be online at about 5pm Central US time…is that accurate?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It is for me; that and 3 or 4am CST are my most likely times to be around.</p>",
